Package: bfbin2arm
Type: Package
Title: Bayes Factor Design for Two-Arm Binomial Trials
Version: 0.1.7
Date: 2026-10-27
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Riko", family = "Kelter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "rkelter@uni-koeln.de"))
Description: Design and analysis of one- and two-stage phase II clinical
    trials using Bayes factors. Implements methods for binomial and
    continuous endpoints, including point-null and directional hypotheses,
    power calculations, and sample size calibration. Supports one-arm
    trials with a single treatment arm and two-arm trials with treatment
    and control arms. Includes methods for equivalence, non-inferiority,
    and superiority designs.
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
